    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming two bedroom mid terrace red brick home brimming with refurbishment potential ideally located just a short stroll from Inchicore village.\r\n\r\nThis superb property features a south facing front patio leading to an attractive red brick façade. The entrance hall opens to a spacious living room with a feature fireplace and understairs storage. The kitchen extension is positioned at the rear of the home and provides access to a sunny back garden which is the perfect place to relax & entertain. Upstairs consists of two double bedrooms with solid wooden floors, fitted wardrobes and ornate fireplaces. This fantastic property also benefits from free on street parking.\r\n\r\nNash Street is ideally located in Inchicore with a range of shops, cafes, bars and restaurants closeby. The Phoenix Park, Memorial Gardens & Grand Canal are closeby proving excellent outdoor facilities. The Red Line LUAS is a short stroll away making the city centre easily accessible. The new children's hospital at St. James's is also closeby."
      },
